{"ref":"BDB, קְהָתִי","hw":"קְהָתִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קְהָתִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> of foreg., c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקּ׳</span> as subst. coll.: <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקּ׳ (-וֹת) מִשְׁפַּחַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:57\" href=\"/Numbers.26.57\">Nu 26:57</a> + 8 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי הַקּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:34\" href=\"/Numbers.4.34\">Nu 4:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.18\">1 Ch 6:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.12\">2 Ch 29:12</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקְּהָתִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:21\" href=\"/Numbers.10.21\">Nu 10:21</a> and <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי הַקּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.19\">2 Ch 20:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.12\">34:12</a>.—Van d. H. has <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקֳּהָתִי(ם)</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:27\" href=\"/Numbers.3.27\">Nu 3:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:21\" href=\"/Numbers.10.21\">10:21</a> + 6 times","next":"BDB, קַו","prev":"BDB, קְהָת"}